cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AtmosBlock: deterministic detection and morphological classification of atmospheric blocking"
abstract: >-
  AtmosBlock combines FAST-IBAN, a deterministic C implementation (OpenMP/MPI) of an atmospheric
  blocking detector based on great-circle sampling of 500 hPa geopotential with Omega/Rex
  morphological classification, and a web portal that runs it on demand on ERA5 reanalysis data.
authors:
  - family-names: "Hernández Sánchez"
    given-names: "Víctor"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Victor-Hndz/AtmosBlock-WebPortal"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - atmospheric blocking
  - geopotential height
  - ERA5
  - climate diagnostics
  - reproducibility
  - OpenMP
  - MPI
